                </p>
                <ul class="ic-points">
                    <li class="ic-point"><span class="ic-point-dot" style="background:#a8d4ce;"></span>Residential &amp; Commercial</li>
                    <li class="ic-point"><span class="ic-point-dot" style="background:#a8d4ce;"></span>Upload evidence PDFs</li>
                    <li class="ic-point"><span class="ic-point-dot" style="background:#a8d4ce;"></span>Rep letter supported</li>
